(3994212, 570674, 30049, '<td valign="top">Yum.  These go well with vanilla ice cream!  :)  As an "artistic" type photo I kind of like it.  Something doesn''t balance quite right.  I almost want to crop it more to a portrait orientation by taking away some from the right and left.  It''s almost like you tried to include too much here.  How about flipping this?  Feels upside down (even tho it may be correct as is).<br/> <br/>All JMO of course.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Yum.  These go well with vanilla ice cream!  :)  As an "artistic" type photo I kind of like it.  Something doesn''t balance quite right.  I almost want to crop it more to a portrait orientation by taking away some from the right and left.  It''s almost like you tried to include too much here.  How about flipping this?  Feels upside down (even tho it may be correct as is). All JMO of course.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-08-13 15:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
