(3998471, 570655, 73235, '<td valign="top">is this the clown from IT? That guy had some simliar brilliant ideas to convince others. :) may be a tigher crop could highlight the burger a bit better?</td>', 'is this the clown from IT? That guy had some simliar brilliant ideas to convince others. :) may be a tigher crop could highlight the burger a bit better?', '2007-08-14 23:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
