(3998513, 569704, 73235, '<td valign="top">I''m one of them. Can I get one? PLEASE? Good DOF and lighting</td>', 'I''m one of them. Can I get one? PLEASE? Good DOF and lighting', '2007-08-14 23:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3998521, 569423, 66267, '<td valign="top">man those biscuits look sweet!</td>', 'man those biscuits look sweet!', '2007-08-14 23:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3998529, 570109, 73235, '<td valign="top">please more attention to details. cropping the plate is ok, cutting the fruit not really. the POV is typical for an adult/child. Could you imagine a more impressive view? may be actually dipping a strawberry? showing a hand dipping?</td>', 'please more attention to details. cropping the plate is ok, cutting the fruit not really. the POV is typical for an adult/child. Could you imagine a more impressive view? may be actually dipping a strawberry? showing a hand dipping?', '2007-08-14 23:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3998535, 570309, 73235, '<td valign="top">good close up, sharp, strong colors, good choice of background.</td>', 'good close up, sharp, strong colors, good choice of background.', '2007-08-14 23:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3998539, 567202, 73235, '<td valign="top">Now you''ll get me in trouble. I want one of those! You can see the fun the kid''s having. Question: did he ever finish? great job.</td>', 'Now you''ll get me in trouble. I want one of those! You can see the fun the kid''s having. Question: did he ever finish? great job.', '2007-08-14 23:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3998541, 570674, 73235, '<td valign="top">the conversion and dualtone is great. Yeah it''s a stretch, so what. It''s food found fast when you''re hiking.</td>', 'the conversion and dualtone is great. Yeah it''s a stretch, so what. It''s food found fast when you''re hiking.', '2007-08-14 23:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3998542, 567528, 6519, '<td valign="top">Surely you must have seen how blurred this is? I don''t understand why you didn''t try again.</td>', 'Surely you must have seen how blurred this is? I don''t understand why you didn''t try again.', '2007-08-14 23:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3998563, 569799, 6519, '<td valign="top">I am surprised you picked a red background instead of another color that would make the red cone pop out at us.</td>', 'I am surprised you picked a red background instead of another color that would make the red cone pop out at us.', '2007-08-14 23:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3998620, 570190, 49930, '<td valign="top">Great lighting. I like the sheen on the edges. Good stuation of colour. Like the frame as well. Well done</td>', 'Great lighting. I like the sheen on the edges. Good stuation of colour. Like the frame as well. Well done', '2007-08-15 00:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3998631, 569205, 49930, '<td valign="top">This one makes me laugh.LOL (humour not criticism) I know someones going to comment about the shadow under the bowl but I think it makes the shot look more real and makes the "burger" the main focus. Well done - I enjoy it.</td>', 'This one makes me laugh.LOL (humour not criticism) I know someones going to comment about the shadow under the bowl but I think it makes the shot look more real and makes the "burger" the main focus. Well done - I enjoy it.', '2007-08-15 00:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3998652, 570655, 65858, '<td valign="top">This one is pretty good, so I''m going to get into the nits:<br/> <br/>Oddly, my eye travels down in the image (maybe because of the tie and suspender lines) instead of to the burger.  Also, I think a solid bkg might have improved the punch.<br/> <br/>Still, very appealing fast food shot!  7</td>', 'This one is pretty good, so I''m going to get into the nits: Oddly, my eye travels down in the image (maybe because of the tie and suspender lines) instead of to the burger.  Also, I think a solid bkg might have improved the punch. Still, very appealing fast food shot!  7', '2007-08-15 00:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3998662, 569205, 65858, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting!  Looks appetizing.  I think the low-ish resolution and high compression (only 40kb?) is hurting this image.  Also, the tilt of the pedestal throws it off.  6.</td>', 'Very nice lighting!  Looks appetizing.  I think the low-ish resolution and high compression (only 40kb?) is hurting this image.  Also, the tilt of the pedestal throws it off.  6.', '2007-08-15 00:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3998678, 569852, 65858, '<td valign="top">Certainly a fast food snapshot.  Others have probably mentioned, but I''ll try to explain why this doesn''t work:<br/> <br/>The lighting is flat, the burger is not "hero" material (bun smooshed, awkward wide angle, burger off-center, odd sauce on the lettuce).  Not highly appealing.<br/> <br/>Better luck next time!</td>', 'Certainly a fast food snapshot.  Others have probably mentioned, but I''ll try to explain why this doesn''t work: The lighting is flat, the burger is not "hero" material (bun smooshed, awkward wide angle, burger off-center, odd sauce on the lettuce).  Not highly appealing. Better luck next time!', '2007-08-15 00:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3998688, 570200, 65858, '<td valign="top">While it is a fast snack, I wouldn''t really call it fast food.  Also, the edges are way sharp, and the bkg colors constant, making it look graphic instead of photographic.  Still, an ok pic.  5.</td>', 'While it is a fast snack, I wouldn''t really call it fast food.  Also, the edges are way sharp, and the bkg colors constant, making it look graphic instead of photographic.  Still, an ok pic.  5.', '2007-08-15 00:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3998697, 568889, 65858, '<td valign="top">Mmm - appetizing and American.  =D  Nice lighting, fresh-looking veggies.  Maybe a bit close up, but generally well done.  7.</td>', 'Mmm - appetizing and American.  =D  Nice lighting, fresh-looking veggies.  Maybe a bit close up, but generally well done.  7.', '2007-08-15 00:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3998704, 570101, 65858, '<td valign="top">Hmm - the inordinate amounts of cheese do look appetizing, but the colors are a bit dull (unappetizing), and the botton bun is smooshed.</td>', 'Hmm - the inordinate amounts of cheese do look appetizing, but the colors are a bit dull (unappetizing), and the botton bun is smooshed.', '2007-08-15 00:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3998731, 570686, 41675, '<td valign="top">Well done. Good entry. The only nit-picky thing preventing me from giving you a ten is the area at the top of their heads. There''s no distinction - especially on the guy. His hair seems to disappear into the background. You should do very well in this challenge. Good luck!!</td>', 'Well done. Good entry. The only nit-picky thing preventing me from giving you a ten is the area at the top of their heads. There''s no distinction - especially on the guy. His hair seems to disappear into the background. You should do very well in this challenge. Good luck!!', '2007-08-15 00:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3998735, 569704, 41675, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, oh yeah! Now this does look good enough to eat. Yum! Well done and good luck in the challenge. This should do well.</td>', 'Hmmm, oh yeah! Now this does look good enough to eat. Yum! Well done and good luck in the challenge. This should do well.', '2007-08-15 00:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
