(4002547, 570564, 59041, '<td valign="top">Awesome!  I just skipped through about 20 or more entries and this shot is out of this world.  Aside from piquing my interest in having a cigarette, this image tells me a long sordid tale of N.A. eating habits and the related negative health effects.  Simply stated, strong message and you did it all without shamefully plugging a free advert for the big boys responsible for "fast food".  Great job!</td>', 'Awesome!  I just skipped through about 20 or more entries and this shot is out of this world.  Aside from piquing my interest in having a cigarette, this image tells me a long sordid tale of N.A. eating habits and the related negative health effects.  Simply stated, strong message and you did it all without shamefully plugging a free advert for the big boys responsible for "fast food".  Great job!', '2007-08-15 22:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
