(4005949, 570415, 76430, '<td valign="top">Very tasty, and excellent meeting of challenge.  Good macro of a delicious looking double cheeseburger.  Is your "o" broken?  8</td>', 'Very tasty, and excellent meeting of challenge.  Good macro of a delicious looking double cheeseburger.  Is your "o" broken?  8', '2007-08-17 02:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
