(4005956, 570655, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice likeness of Jack, other than the sunken eyes, great looking burger, and picture worthy of an ad.  8</td>', 'Nice likeness of Jack, other than the sunken eyes, great looking burger, and picture worthy of an ad.  8', '2007-08-17 02:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4005957, 570309, 76430, '<td valign="top">This does look really good, which is surprising for just a hotdog with a little mustard.  I like the blue background.  Simple but good one.  8</td>', 'This does look really good, which is surprising for just a hotdog with a little mustard.  I like the blue background.  Simple but good one.  8', '2007-08-17 02:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4005958, 569873, 76430, '<td valign="top">You ain''t from around these here parts is you?  The naughts got twice the turns of the crosses and still lost the game.  Nice composition, lighting, cropping.  8</td>', 'You ain''t from around these here parts is you?  The naughts got twice the turns of the crosses and still lost the game.  Nice composition, lighting, cropping.  8', '2007-08-17 02:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4005960, 568571, 76430, '<td valign="top">I love the cat''s expression, even though it''s more than likely not rejecting it but getting ready to lick it.  Another heart-attack in a bun.  It may be cropped a bit too close, but still a nice shot.</td>', 'I love the cat''s expression, even though it''s more than likely not rejecting it but getting ready to lick it.  Another heart-attack in a bun.  It may be cropped a bit too close, but still a nice shot.', '2007-08-17 02:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4005961, 569423, 76430, '<td valign="top">One way to combat the effects of high fat/calorie/cholesterol food, cut down the portions.  And and American flag to boot.  Who in the USA could object to that?</td>', 'One way to combat the effects of high fat/calorie/cholesterol food, cut down the portions.  And and American flag to boot.  Who in the USA could object to that?', '2007-08-17 02:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4005962, 570220, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp images for what appears to be a time exposure.  I''ll be interested to see how you did this, whether the apples were lifted up or more likely dropped at the end of the exposure, but I don''t see what lifted or guided them.</td>', 'Nice sharp images for what appears to be a time exposure.  I''ll be interested to see how you did this, whether the apples were lifted up or more likely dropped at the end of the exposure, but I don''t see what lifted or guided them.', '2007-08-17 02:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4005964, 570315, 76430, '<td valign="top">Ooh, poor little Thumper.  Formerly fast food.  Good capture.  I''ll be interested to see where this is.</td>', 'Ooh, poor little Thumper.  Formerly fast food.  Good capture.  I''ll be interested to see where this is.', '2007-08-17 02:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4005965, 569123, 76430, '<td valign="top">I WISH Mickie D''s would serve stuff as healthy as that and I might go back there.  I love broccoli, but it would be better steamed almost tender and lightly buttered and salted.  Good background and lighting, though the top of the broccoli reflects a bit too much.</td>', 'I WISH Mickie D''s would serve stuff as healthy as that and I might go back there.  I love broccoli, but it would be better steamed almost tender and lightly buttered and salted.  Good background and lighting, though the top of the broccoli reflects a bit too much.', '2007-08-17 02:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4005966, 570651, 76430, '<td valign="top">That really brings back good childhood memories.</td>', 'That really brings back good childhood memories.', '2007-08-17 02:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
