(4007257, 569868, 68256, '<td valign="top">Ahh, great composition and lighting.  I can almost taste the Dr. Pepper.  You did use Dr. Pepper didn''t you?  The only thing I don''t like is the one straw being cut off throws my eye clear off the photo.  Bumping up to a 9....</td>', 'Ahh, great composition and lighting.  I can almost taste the Dr. Pepper.  You did use Dr. Pepper didn''t you?  The only thing I don''t like is the one straw being cut off throws my eye clear off the photo.  Bumping up to a 9....', '2007-08-17 16:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
