(4007269, 570309, 68256, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and lighting.  I really like that you kept it simple.  The zigzag mustard is a nice touch to break up the horizontal lines.</td>', 'Excellent composition and lighting.  I really like that you kept it simple.  The zigzag mustard is a nice touch to break up the horizontal lines.', '2007-08-17 16:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
