(4007430, 569245, 68947, '<td valign="top">oh, gawd.....I''m gonna gain another 20 lbs by the time I''m finished voting in this challenge!  Ok, you made me want this!  Good mark from me here!</td>', 'oh, gawd.....I''m gonna gain another 20 lbs by the time I''m finished voting in this challenge!  Ok, you made me want this!  Good mark from me here!', '2007-08-17 18:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
