(4007449, 570175, 68947, '<td valign="top">Yeah, now there''s a "double meaning"! LOL......light on the finger, heavy on the hips!  But, made me want one!  Shoulda eaten BEFORE I voted! *grin*  Love the burger balancing on the finger tip there.  Really, really creative shot!!!</td>', 'Yeah, now there''s a "double meaning"! LOL......light on the finger, heavy on the hips!  But, made me want one!  Shoulda eaten BEFORE I voted! *grin*  Love the burger balancing on the finger tip there.  Really, really creative shot!!!', '2007-08-17 18:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4007451, 568889, 68947, '<td valign="top">Now, THIS COULD be on an advertisement!  Nice crop, nice closeup!  LOVE IT!!!  CONGRATS!  Bet you''re getting some great scores!</td>', 'Now, THIS COULD be on an advertisement!  Nice crop, nice closeup!  LOVE IT!!!  CONGRATS!  Bet you''re getting some great scores!', '2007-08-17 18:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
