(4009092, 569862, 42869, '<td valign="top">Flash light is a bit too harsh in the reflections of the glass and silverware.  Try putting a piece of waxed paper over your camera flash to diffuse the light a little more next time - just a suggestion...</td>', 'Flash light is a bit too harsh in the reflections of the glass and silverware.  Try putting a piece of waxed paper over your camera flash to diffuse the light a little more next time - just a suggestion...', '2007-08-18 12:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4009095, 570462, 42869, '<td valign="top">Nice color but too shallow DOF - this would have worked really well if everything would have been in sharp focus - the soft grill tool distracts.  The backlighting of the flame makes it difficult to really see what the food is - I get that it''s in a heart shape, but is it a burger?  If so, is that cheese on top of it?  Good idea.</td>', 'Nice color but too shallow DOF - this would have worked really well if everything would have been in sharp focus - the soft grill tool distracts.  The backlighting of the flame makes it difficult to really see what the food is - I get that it''s in a heart shape, but is it a burger?  If so, is that cheese on top of it?  Good idea.', '2007-08-18 12:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4009099, 570315, 42869, '<td valign="top">I''ll be interested to see what kinds of comments you get on this one... Technically this is a well composed shot - good exposure, nice colors, focus is right on - it will be the subject that brings this shot down</td>', 'I''ll be interested to see what kinds of comments you get on this one... Technically this is a well composed shot - good exposure, nice colors, focus is right on - it will be the subject that brings this shot down', '2007-08-18 12:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
