(4010221, 569873, 4967, '<td valign="top">I love this image... bright/beautifully done/well lit image such a fancy border however I think detracts from the actualy photograph you took... and don''t think it was the best choice I guess I''m not big on adding things in photoshop. Anyway. -9- (moved you up from a seven on second pass.)</td>', 'I love this image... bright/beautifully done/well lit image such a fancy border however I think detracts from the actualy photograph you took... and don''t think it was the best choice I guess I''m not big on adding things in photoshop. Anyway. -9- (moved you up from a seven on second pass.)', '2007-08-19 01:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010223, 570212, 4967, '<td valign="top">looks good... nicely done.</td>', 'looks good... nicely done.', '2007-08-19 01:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010229, 567202, 4967, '<td valign="top">that is one big burger... not sure it makes me want to go out and grab fast food though. overall I think this image is very well done and well lit....</td>', 'that is one big burger... not sure it makes me want to go out and grab fast food though. overall I think this image is very well done and well lit....', '2007-08-19 01:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
