(4010864, 569873, 45194, '<td valign="top">Very creative layout....nicely shot.  Nice job on the border. Not sure exactly what you''ve done but it looks like you''ve used something for the grid and found a matching border for it.  Nice job.  Well matched.</td>', 'Very creative layout....nicely shot.  Nice job on the border. Not sure exactly what you''ve done but it looks like you''ve used something for the grid and found a matching border for it.  Nice job.  Well matched.', '2007-08-19 12:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010869, 569123, 45194, '<td valign="top">Great take on this theme.  The colors are nice and the photo crisp and clean.  Should be a no brainer for the top 3 if not the blue ribbon.</td>', 'Great take on this theme.  The colors are nice and the photo crisp and clean.  Should be a no brainer for the top 3 if not the blue ribbon.', '2007-08-19 12:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010872, 568519, 45194, '<td valign="top">Clever shot...nice composition.  Clean and interesting photo.  Not to take anything away from you but this was a really weak challenge. This should be a ribbon winner no problem.</td>', 'Clever shot...nice composition.  Clean and interesting photo.  Not to take anything away from you but this was a really weak challenge. This should be a ribbon winner no problem.', '2007-08-19 12:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010877, 570655, 45194, '<td valign="top">Come on now! Tell me you didn''t go out and make a Jack in the Box head just for this shot!  Nice job on this one.  I really like it but unfortunately I don''t think it will ribbon. I just hope you didn''t spend forever or big $$ on the Jack head.  Good job.</td>', 'Come on now! Tell me you didn''t go out and make a Jack in the Box head just for this shot!  Nice job on this one.  I really like it but unfortunately I don''t think it will ribbon. I just hope you didn''t spend forever or big $$ on the Jack head.  Good job.', '2007-08-19 12:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010880, 569993, 45194, '<td valign="top">Very funny picture!</td>', 'Very funny picture!', '2007-08-19 12:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010885, 569868, 45194, '<td valign="top">Not my favorite for some reason but very nicely shot and nice colors too.  The thumbnail of the photo really grabs me.  Good luck</td>', 'Not my favorite for some reason but very nicely shot and nice colors too.  The thumbnail of the photo really grabs me.  Good luck', '2007-08-19 12:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010889, 570175, 45194, '<td valign="top">Good color and lighting but made me immediately think "cliche" or "overdone" for some reason.  It''s not a bad photo, it just doesn''t seem original</td>', 'Good color and lighting but made me immediately think "cliche" or "overdone" for some reason.  It''s not a bad photo, it just doesn''t seem original', '2007-08-19 12:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010891, 570235, 45194, '<td valign="top">I get it! Funny.  At first I didn''t get it but when I did I got a good chuckle.  Don''t think you''ll score very well for this shot but thanks for entering it anyway.</td>', 'I get it! Funny.  At first I didn''t get it but when I did I got a good chuckle.  Don''t think you''ll score very well for this shot but thanks for entering it anyway.', '2007-08-19 12:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010896, 570564, 45194, '<td valign="top">This picture really makes a statement and I love that about it.  Unfortunately the photo itself isn''t as appealing as I had hoped.  What I THINK I see is a french fry in an ashtray posing as a ciggerette and that would be a powerful statement. However, there seems to be beads of water or something in the photo which makes me wonder if it is an ashtray or if I''ve missed the point. Is it a sink drain?  If it was more clear that this was an ashtray I''d scored it much higher. Good luck. If you ribbon with it it will still be deserved.</td>', 'This picture really makes a statement and I love that about it.  Unfortunately the photo itself isn''t as appealing as I had hoped.  What I THINK I see is a french fry in an ashtray posing as a ciggerette and that would be a powerful statement. However, there seems to be beads of water or something in the photo which makes me wonder if it is an ashtray or if I''ve missed the point. Is it a sink drain?  If it was more clear that this was an ashtray I''d scored it much higher. Good luck. If you ribbon with it it will still be deserved.', '2007-08-19 12:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010898, 568571, 45194, '<td valign="top">The burger looks disgusting but I do really enjoy the cats expression/face.  That is what really makes this shot. Not sure how you did it but good job on the cat''s reaction.</td>', 'The burger looks disgusting but I do really enjoy the cats expression/face.  That is what really makes this shot. Not sure how you did it but good job on the cat''s reaction.', '2007-08-19 12:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010901, 570127, 45194, '<td valign="top">Poorly lit and not the best composition.</td>', 'Poorly lit and not the best composition.', '2007-08-19 12:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
