(4012460, 569873, 5112, '<td valign="top">Good one.  Good idea, good layout, very good light control.  If I''d had to poin out a "nitpick" or two, (1) I am not sure about the border, it matches, but it''s almost too much of a good thing; (2) I really wish the donut at bottom were not cut off (and maybe just a touch more space by the one in middle right).  ~9</td>', 'Good one.  Good idea, good layout, very good light control.  If I''d had to poin out a "nitpick" or two, (1) I am not sure about the border, it matches, but it''s almost too much of a good thing; (2) I really wish the donut at bottom were not cut off (and maybe just a touch more space by the one in middle right).  ~9', '2007-08-19 23:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
