(4022644, 569437, 62318, '<td valign="top">Sorry, you got robbed. This should be in the 3s. Even with the focus issues, it still should have been low fours at worse. <br/> <br/>You did well to fill the frame, as most food/macro shots it is good to remove the dead spaces. I like the varied textures of the bun and the chips, good combination there. Next time try a couple of different angles (maybe you did that?). I''d almost cut off the top 1/8th or so of the picture. Don''t worry about the comments about "camera phone" and what not. Photography is more than just about shock value. Cheers. <br/> <br/>Now to go an check out the rest of your gallery. :)</td>', 'Sorry, you got robbed. This should be in the 3s. Even with the focus issues, it still should have been low fours at worse.  You did well to fill the frame, as most food/macro shots it is good to remove the dead spaces. I like the varied textures of the bun and the chips, good combination there. Next time try a couple of different angles (maybe you did that?). I''d almost cut off the top 1/8th or so of the picture. Don''t worry about the comments about "camera phone" and what not. Photography is more than just about shock value. Cheers.  Now to go an check out the rest of your gallery. :)', '2007-08-22 22:27:56.000000', NULL, 0),
